WEBVTT

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.670
U-Um...

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.550
Are you okay?

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.130
Yeah. You're really strong, Beta-san.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:26.430
Up we go!

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:29.140
Her footwork...

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.010
Her movements...

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.770
Her hip positioning...

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:32.520
Her posture...

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.100
She's an amateur.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.190
Yeah, she's totally an amateur.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:41.320
I cannot imagine her being of the caliber of master samurai at all.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.190
However...

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:51.040
Since she has that insignia, we have to accept that Jyuubei is a master samurai.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:56.040
By the way, I wonder who Jyuubei's general is?

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.170
Hm?

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.380
Only the men of the Tokugawa shogunate household have the qualifications of a general.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:05.300
If the contract ritual only occurs in the hall of rituals in Edo Castle...

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:10.140
the possibility of having a master samurai that the shogunate doesn't recognize is zero.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:14.020
The more I think about it, the more mysterious it gets.

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:20.860
If she wasn't after Muneakira...

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.150
I have a theory.

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:27.110
A theory?

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:29.700
Listen carefully.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:30.830
Jyuubei's general is...

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:32.120
Her general is...?

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:34.750
Senhime-sama.

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.040
Good day, you criminals.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.540
Your punishment has been decided upon.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.980
I temporarily opened the main gate.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.810
Leave this academy by tomorrow morning.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.110
What turn of events is this?

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:28.740
Yagyuu Muneakira and Sanada Yukimura did not meet.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:32.910
Therefore, Muneakira is innocent and exempt from punishment. I just want to deal with it this way.

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:35.160
Thank you very much, Senhime-sama.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.580
Now Yukimura and Matabei-san ca-

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.660
I didn't give you permission to speak.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:42.210
I-Indeed...

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:44.880
We're going, Matabei.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.380
Yukimura...

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:54.930
Jyuubei-san.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:59.470
I can tell that you're a good person.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.190
We'll be able to meet again soon.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.810
What are you doing, Matabei? Let's go!

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.110
They're gone...

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:17.700
Yeah, the dojo's gonna be pretty lonely again.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:19.620
Are you so sure of that?

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:23.870
One Hour Later...

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:24.370
Yamato Nadeshiko
Unparalleled under the heavens

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.670
Well, I guess that's about it.

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:38.350
Why are you so <i>lovingly</i> giving a holy dojo the devil's makeover?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:42.980
Because a princess of the Tokugawa household can't be living in such a drab place, can she?

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.020
Eh?!

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:45.690
What did you just say?

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:47.270
I said I'm living here.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.690
I'll be watching over this suspicious woman.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:56.280
N-N-N-N-No way!

00:04:57.990 --> 00:04:59.410
Convincing Muneakira

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.910
Convincing... Convincing

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.410
Convincing

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.170
Thank you for the meal!

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.170
Thank you.
Thank you for the meal!

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.250
No problem, eat up.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:12.550
Senhime-sama?

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:13.970
I'm done.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:16.050
I-I'm glad you enjoyed it-

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.390
Oh, sure I "enjoyed it".

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:20.470
What are these fish? Were they farmed?

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:24.770
They're fish I bought at the fish store in the commercial area, so I don't know exactly...

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:27.690
I can't tell who in their right mind would eat this.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:30.770
And look at this miso soup...

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.360
Where are the bonito shavings for the broth from?

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.730
Where is the salt from?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:34.530
The kelp?

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.440
The tofu?

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:36.990
U-Uh...

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:39.910
This liquid might be poison for all I know. There's no way I could drink it.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:46.120
The bodies of peasants sure are made to be durable.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.830
This is unreasonable.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:52.420
Saying she'll live here all of a sudden, forcing me to make a meal, and with these complaints to top it off...

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:56.550
Poor Hanzou, she's hardly touched any of these either.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:57.220
Right?

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.010
Y-Yes!

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:03.930
Oh well. Starting tomorrow, I'll have an exclusive chef make the meals and carry them here.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:04.600
Eh?

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:09.560
You can't become a good samurai if you keep eating things that came from who-knows-where, can you?

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.190
Y-You're absolutely right!

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:15.900
Hmph. You get to have these benefits solely because you're living with me.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:17.780
How lucky of you, Muneakira.

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.700
Aah, that was delicious!

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.990
Thanks for the meal, Onii-chan!

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:24.120
Glad you enjoyed it.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.330
Wow, you ate all of it by yourself!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.290
Yup, because it was so good!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:33.540
You're as good as Beta-san at cooking, Onii-chan!

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:36.210
I was always making my own meals, after all.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.420
Amazing!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.380
Hey hey, Onii-chan.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.590
Teach Jyuubei how to cook later, too!

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:42.720
Sure, why not...?

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.720
Yay!

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:47.560
Then from now on, Jyuubei will take care of making all the meals.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.310
Go easy on me.

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:51.400
Your eyes are saying you don't believe me!

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.070
Muneakira.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:58.320
Wh-What is it?

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:02.240
I said <i>I</i>  would prepare the high-quality ingredients and top-class chef, did I not?

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:07.370
But it's probably a bother, so if they could arrange to just bring Senhime-sama's portion...

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:09.210
Jyuubei will be making the rest!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:13.000
Gah, that pisses me off! Why are you acting like his wife?!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.960
I'm not his wife. Jyuubei is his little sister.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:17.800
Little sister?!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:22.390
A master samurai with amnesia who came falling from the sky; as if a little sister that unique would exist!

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:24.100
That's not right.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:29.810
Jyuubei is a little sister with amnesia who came falling from the sky, not a master samurai.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.140
You have an insignia of the contract on your chest!

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:36.070
I do, but I'm weak. I couldn't beat Beta-san at all.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:40.990
Anyway! If you have time to be cooking, you should focus on remembering who you are!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:44.490
Otherwise, I'll chase you out of here and lock you up in a prison or something.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:44.910
Eh?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:50.500
It's because something random like you plummeted to Earth that Muneakira and I are <i>really</i> inconvenienced!

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.920
That's not true, right, Onii-chan?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.210
She doesn't look like a bad girl.

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:57.800
But...

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:03.880
Having seen that form, we have to know what her true form is.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:11.980
Oh? I thought you were just stupid, but you can read the mood at least a little.

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:14.230
Ohii-sama, I think you might be going over-

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:19.780
Hey Jyuubei, if there's anything that you remember, can you tell us, no matter what it is?

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:22.860
Don't worry if it's something small. That might trigger-

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:23.530
I remembered.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.740
I remembered everything.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:27.280
Really?

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:28.160
Yup.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.080
To be honest...

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.580
Jyuubei's...

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.080
true form is...

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.800
A doggie!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:42.970
Woof woof!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:45.550
Woof woof!

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:47.640
Woof!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:51.560
Jyuubei's true form is a doggie, woof!

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:54.440
So I'm going to live here from now on, woof.

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:57.060
Come out, Jyuubei.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.730
Onii-chan, please.

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:05.200
Keep Jyuubei by your side, Onii-chan.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.610
Eh?

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:09.620
Jyuubei needs Onii-chan.

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.950
Without Onii-chan, Jyuubei will become useless!

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:14.540
B-Become useless?

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.290
I don't mind living here... I'll even cook for you!

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:21.090
I won't bother Onii-chan or Senhime-san or Hanzou-san!

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:23.840
So please, let me be with you!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.340
Being alone is too scary...!

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.390
Handle this.

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.360
Sorry. I was being mean.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:02.380
It doesn't seem like we'll get anything from interrogating her.

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:03.380
Yeah.

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:07.630
How about we search for Jyuubei's general instead?

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:08.300
Yeah.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:12.220
By the way, Yukimura was saying something interesting.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:15.810
She said she might have a theory about who Jyuubei's general is.

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:17.520
Everything you say is about Jyuubei.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:22.940
Even though we met for the first time in 10 years, and finally have some time to talk alone.

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:28.360
Do you have something formal to talk about?

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:31.120
Whatever...

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.580
Anyway, skim through this.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:35.450
What's this?

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:36.700
The Spirited Away Incident.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:43.840
Students have been disappearing from this academy for a few years now. Those are the detailed files.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:49.680
The shogunate's been enforcing a gag order any way it can, but the students have already started spreading rumors.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:51.800
Any leads?

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:52.720
None.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:55.760
But we know the culprits.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.190
Sanada Yukimura and Gotou Matabei.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:04.610
One Month Ago...
One Month Ago...

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:07.780
Onii-sama, I don't really understand what you're saying.

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:12.700
It's too early to say that those two are the culprits behind the Spirited Away Incident.

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.160
Well, they're of the Toyotomi faction, right?

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:18.410
It's not too far-fetched to think they might kidnap a student or two.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.500
But...

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:22.000
Anyway, put them on the wanted list for me. Thanks.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.500
Onii-sama?

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.500
Onii-sama!

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:33.260
As you know, Yoshihiko Onii-sama is the student council president of this academy.

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:38.310
He is the one who will eventually lead the Tokugawa household and become the next Supreme General of Great Japan.

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:45.150
He is adept, both physically and mentally, and is using his ability for foreign relations while still attending school.

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:50.900
Even now he's taking care of some difficult topics in France.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:55.070
Why did a person as great as Yoshihiko-sama make such a careless decision?

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:56.410
I don't know.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:04.290
But I have a bad feeling about all of this: the disappearing students, Yukimura's fortune, Onii-sama's strange actions.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:07.710
I can't help but feel that something's happening in this academy.

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:11.630
Capturing the Toyotomi faction is just a cover-up.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:18.890
The true reason I was summoned to this academy is to help investigate these incidents.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:20.310
Am I right?

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.190
I see.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:26.440
I will be glad to cooperate, however little I may contribute.

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:30.400
You're so simple-minded, you don't know what might happen if you disobey!

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:33.780
You have to consider those risks a little before answe-

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.830
You're so stupid...

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:12.820
A-A dream?

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.580
NOOOOO!

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:24.200
That voice was...?

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:24.500
Jyuubei!

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.330
W-Wait, Muneakira!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.290
Jyuubei-san, what's wrong?!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.420
Jyuubei-san, hang in there.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:33.380
Jyuubei-san!
What happened?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.420
Hanzou, what is this?

00:13:34.420 --> 00:13:36.840
I don't know. I heard her scream and when I got here-

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:39.390
Muneakira-san, please do something!

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.180
Senhime-sama, please stay there.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:45.480
I'm scared! Onii-chan, I'm scared...!

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:45.980
Jyuubei.

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:50.190
Where did Jyuubei come from? Who is Jyuubei?

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:52.320
Jyuubei is, Jyuubei is...!

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:55.860
Calm down, you don't have to worry about that right now.

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:57.610
Don't think of anything unnecessary.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.240
Onii-chan...

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.660
Good girl, it's all going to be fine now.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.120
Did you have a bad dream?

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.330
Yeah. Jyuubei was, Jyuubei was-

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.290
Get away from her.

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:10.630
Ohii-sama?

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.380
I'm telling you to get away from that girl.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:14.760
Senhime-sama, what are you...?

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.630
Whatever, just get away from that girl!

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:18.470
But, Jyuubei's still-

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:21.680
Shut up! You said that you'd only fight for me back there!

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.760
That has nothing to do with thi-

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:25.720
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:28.520
Muneakira, you just have to shut up and listen to what I tell-

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.440
Onii-chan...

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.900
Jyuubei?

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.720
Yagyuu
Jyuubei

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:08.850
Jyuubei...?

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:12.730
Hmph. I just can't sit around and watch this.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.230
Y-You are-

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:15.150
Could she be from that time?

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:17.730
Analyzing

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:18.570
Analysis Complete

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:19.570
5,000,000
Power Level
Attention

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:21.740
I didn't make a mistake after all!

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:24.660
Ohii-sama, she's dangerous. Please run!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:27.540
Run? You must be joking.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.370
How dare you kiss in front of me!

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:32.290
I won't forgive you, no matter what!

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:37.840
Muneakira, choose who you surround yourself with more carefully.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:41.880
Seems like you seriously want to get thrown in prison.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:43.090
Please wai-

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.600
Ohii-sama, please run!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.610
H-Hanzou.

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:58.780
Hanzou!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:07.410
Damn you, I won't forgive you!

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:09.790
Senhime-sama!

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:12.370
Again, what's happening?

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:16.250
Please run, Senhime-sama!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.460
Stop kidding around! If you go against me-

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:30.020
The Tokugawa princess, eh? Once naked, she's just another woman.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:31.680
Obscene!

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:32.850
Jealousy...

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:39.610
If you are so inexperienced as to be unable to suppress your own ugly emotions, could you stand with a country on your back?

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:43.110
Don't!

00:16:43.110 --> 00:16:44.450
Stop, Jyuubei!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.200
Is the general also inexperienced?

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.250
This ends now!

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:56.170
You two!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.590
Sanada Yukimura has arrived!

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:00.170
Yukimura, Matabei-san!

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.970
My theory seems to have been correct after all.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:07.140
Yagyuu Muneakira, you are her general.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:10.560
The kiss holds the same significance as the contract ritual,

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:14.940
and in exchange for Jyuubei's awakening, Muneakira loses control of his body.

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:15.730
No way...!

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:19.650
That evil aura, that indiscriminate impulse to destroy...

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:22.440
Yagyuu Jyuubei, I am now sure!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:24.740
You're the shadow covering Great Japan!

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:27.070
Oh?

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.280
We'll be your opponents.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:29.490
Eh?

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:32.790
Or is there no chance of you emerging victorious against two enemies?

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.330
Sounds fun.

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:40.040
Don't, Jyuubei!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:44.260
Do it, Matabei!

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:45.300
Okay!

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:52.560
You fool!

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.560
Over here! Come!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.520
Will she come?

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:03.400
Calm down. She's not the type to lie dormant after being mocked.

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:05.440
Anyway, you know the plan, right?

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:06.150
Yes.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.700
Such a simple tactic.

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:26.760
Well then, what's next?

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.810
Everything is going according to Yukimura-sama's strategy.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:36.810
You impudent-

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.350
Don't underestimate Matabei's strength.

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:43.270
Feel my Sanada military strategy with your own bones!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.730
Sanada style technique:

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.610
Field of Evil Restraint and Destruction!

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:54.620
That field is a holy area which damages evil.

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:57.750
The perfect prison for you.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.460
It doesn't hurt. It doesn't even itch.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.130
Are you saying you're not evil?

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:07.800
Time to stop playing along.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.100
Yukimura-sama!

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.190
Stand.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:26.860
This is a single-match swordsmanship challenge.

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:28.280
Bring it.

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.330
Jyuubei?!

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:46.090
STOP!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:48.510
It seems like you're starting to understand.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:56.260
If you focused on protecting yourself, you would've fended off at least a single blow.

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:59.680
Matabei, was it? Any regrets?

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:08.570
That I couldn't protect Yukimura-sama means I didn't fulfill my role as a samurai.

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:13.160
Yukimura-sama!

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:17.660
Why?

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:21.000
There was something impressive in your devotion to your master.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:28.250
If one draws one's katana and faces the other, the samurai is fated to continue until one of the flowers has scattered.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.590
But this time, I'll break that rule.

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.220
Yukimura, where are you?!

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:37.600
Gotou Matabei, answer me!

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:41.390
She could have discarded you two as mere pawns and ran away herself, yet...

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:47.060
It seems as though a samurai was asleep in that joke of a princess's heart as well.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.400
Jyuubei-san, who are you...?

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:54.570
Today's swordsmanship challenge ends here.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.290
Yukimura! Matabei!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.790
Are you all right?

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.710
What in the world...?

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:12.630
So we ended up learning nothing again.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:15.130
Who in the world is she?

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:16.380
She's a samurai.

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:20.600
She's violent, moody and has a bad mouth...

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:24.180
But like us, she's a samurai.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.600
Yagyuu Jyuubei.

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:32.280
Who in the world are you?

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:13.960
Jyuubei's 30-second cooking!

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:15.840
Today we'll be making miso soup!

00:23:15.840 --> 00:23:17.710
First, we boil water in a pot...

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:18.470
Oh...!

00:23:18.470 --> 00:23:22.010
While that happens, we cut the daikon radish and the deep-fried bean curd, and then we dump it in.

00:23:22.010 --> 00:23:22.760
Yup yup.

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:26.770
And then, when it boils again, you pretend to put the miso in and boom!

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:28.480
Whoa, what are you doing Jyuubei?!

00:23:28.480 --> 00:23:32.440
Where's the enemy? My katana is thirsting for blood tonight!

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:34.650
She's the scary Jyuubei all a sudden!

00:23:34.650 --> 00:23:35.440
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran:

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:36.190
Hey,
Please Kiss Me?
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran:

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:37.940
Hey,
Please Kiss Me?

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:40.360
Um, what about the miso soup...?
Hey,
Please Kiss Me?

00:23:40.360 --> 00:23:40.990
Hey,
Please Kiss Me?
